5" end="20.140">in</span><span begin="20.140" end="21.062">to</span> <span begin="21.062" end="21.676">the</span> <span begin="21.676" end="22.950">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当它沉入夜色</span></p><p begin="26.739" end="29.897" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.739" end="28.227">Hold</span> <span begin="28.227" end="28.441">it</span> <span begin="28.441" end="29.897">tight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将过往倾洒</span></p><p begin="31.630" end="40.927" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.630" end="32.097">The</span> <span begin="32.097" end="32.741">star</span><span begin="32.741" end="33.272">light&apos;s</span> <span begin="33.272" end="34.740">shim</span><span begin="34.740" end="35.006">me</span><span begin="35.006" end="36.491">ring</span> <span begin="36.491" end="36.757">in</span> <span begin="36.757" end="38.339">my</span> <span begin="38.339" end="40.927">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星光在眼眸流转</span></p><p begin="41.854" end="47.556" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.854" end="42.547">Hope</span> <span begin="42.547" end="43.130">a</span><span begin="43.130" end="44.724">rises</span> <span begin="44.724" end="45.886">beneath</span> <span begin="45.886" end="46.564">the</span> <span begin="46.564" end="47.556">skies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">希望在苍穹苏醒</span></p><p begin="47.946" end="54.478" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.946" end="48.234">The</span> <span begin="48.234" end="48.982">spark</span> <span begin="48.982" end="49.446">burns</span> <span begin="49.446" end="49.665">in</span> <span begin="49.665" end="49.957">my</span> <span begin="49.957" end="50.516">hand</span> <span begin="50.516" end="50.998">for</span><span begin="50.998" end="51.585">ever</span> <span begin="51.585" end="53.275">ig</span><span begin="53.275" end="54.478">nites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">火种燃于掌心，永恒